@guide H_Shadowmoon
@name Shadowmoon Valley (Shadowmoon Village)
@faction Horde
@levels 68-70
@zone Shadowmoon Valley
@chapter Outland
@desc Shadowmoon Village: the Legion Hold chain, the Deathforge, the Hand of Gul'dan approach and the Illidari quests. Ends at 70.

